#: templates/about.html:58
msgid "about_main_title"
msgstr "ABOUT THE PROJECT"

#: templates/about.html:61
msgid "about_main_subtitle"
msgstr ""
"Cognitive simulation platform for national security and countering FIMI "
"threats."

#: templates/about.html:69
msgid "about_vision_title"
msgstr "PROJECT VISION"

#: templates/about.html:74
msgid "about_vision_p1_tag"
msgstr "01 // ORIGIN"

#: templates/about.html:75
msgid "about_vision_p1"
msgstr ""
"ANTARES (Adversarial Narrative Threat Analysis and Response Evaluation "
"System) started as a personal project — a proof-of-concept I developed to"
" explore new frontiers in cognitive security. More than a simple coding "
"exercise, it's a portfolio piece and an independent research lab, built "
"to imagine different, proactive approaches to countering disinformation."

#: templates/about.html:78
msgid "about_vision_p2_tag"
msgstr "02 // CONTEXT"

#: templates/about.html:79
msgid "about_vision_p2"
msgstr ""
"Today's FIMI (Foreign Interference and Information Manipulation) "
"campaigns rarely rely on inventing news out of thin air; far more often "
"they weaponize real facts, manipulating narratives to widen social "
"divides. Faced with these threats, the traditional approach is almost "
"always reactive: fact-checking and debunking hoaxes only after the "
"cognitive \"virus\" has already spread and the damage is done. With this "
"project, I wanted to flip that perspective, starting from a core "
"cybersecurity principle applied to the information ecosystem: to defeat "
"an adversary, you first have to learn to think like one."

#: templates/about.html:82
msgid "about_vision_p3_tag"
msgstr "03 // METHOD"

#: templates/about.html:83
msgid "about_vision_p3"
msgstr ""
"The application works as a genuine \"gym\" for cyber and cognitive "
"defense. The system proactively simulates adversarial disinformation "
"tactics, adopting the perspective of known hostile actors to understand "
"how they might exploit, distort, or polarize a given news story. This "
"adversarial simulation exercise is carried out with a strictly ethical "
"and defensive purpose: the goal is not to generate disinformation, but to"
" anticipate narrative vulnerabilities before they are exploited."

#: templates/about.html:86
msgid "about_vision_p4_tag"
msgstr "04 // OUTPUT"

#: templates/about.html:87
msgid "about_vision_p4"
msgstr ""
"By anticipating in advance which \"angle\" or emotional tone an attacker "
"might use, ANTARES closes the loop by automatically generating defensive "
"response playbooks. In this way, artificial intelligence becomes a tool "
"for building resilience, giving communication and security professionals "
"what they need to prepare counter-narratives and preventive mitigation "
"strategies."

#: templates/about.html:91
msgid "about_vision_p5"
msgstr ""
"This is my personal vision of how technology can help us move from a "
"passive, perpetually-behind information defense to a strategic model "
"grounded in anticipation and preparedness."

#: templates/about.html:102
msgid "disclaimer_title"
msgstr "DEMONSTRATION PROJECT"

#: templates/about.html:106
msgid "disclaimer_text"
msgstr ""
"This app was developed as a demonstration project and proof-of-concept "
"for defense against cognitive manipulation and FIMI (Foreign Interference"
" and Information Manipulation). The system simulates adversarial "
"disinformation tactics solely to anticipate narrative vulnerabilities and"
" automatically generate defensive response playbooks."

